  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup butter, cubed",
    "2 pounds red potatoes, halved",
    "1 tablespoon minced onion, or to taste",
    "2 tablespoons minced fresh parsley",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/S1LnOsa0cE3biId6YjaY9mlZlIs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228262-oven-baked-parsley-red-potatoes-step-1-a3c612a138864d2ba1d5cb8da5496bc8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228262/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Place butter into a large baking dish and set in the oven while preheating.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MrjIc_wAEU_J17u7DM3WN1bUauA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228262-oven-baked-parsley-red-potatoes-step-2-26039cf748d34f9186e3d46051113a5a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228262/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the baking dish from the oven. Add potatoes and onion and toss until thoroughly coated with butter; this will give them a nicely browned and slightly crisp coating.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oZi100Jx00i7lgmLY00LjkLHxiM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228262-oven-baked-parsley-red-potatoes-step-3-6fdc03679b08450a877fc53cdf659b45.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228262/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until potatoes are tender, about 40 minutes. Remove from the oven and sprinkle with parsley, salt, and pepper. Toss until well coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5p7A2z-c8ffaVC3gdidGLUq7cwk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228262-oven-baked-parsley-red-potatoes-step-4-0b2e1312e4c74dadaff03d584aa406ea.jpg"
